2. **Low Attachment (VP-Adjunct to the embedded clause):** The PP adjoins to the intermediate projection of the embedded verb (*visit*). In this parse, the act of swearing occurred at an unspecified time, but the visit is scheduled for Saturday.
    * *Paraphrase:* Alex made a promise that his visit to his grandfather would happen on Saturday.

