In the X-bar structure, this simply adds another AdjP branching off of a newly generated N̅ node above the N̅ that branches to "white". The structural hierarchy for the NP would now be:
*   NP → Det N̅₁
*   N̅₁ → AdjP(small) N̅₂
*   N̅₂ → AdjP(white) N̅₃
*   N̅₃ → AdjP(fluffy) N̅₄
*   N̅₄ → N(mouse)

