### 3. Expanded Recursion

To add another layer of the same type of recursion (Saxon Genitive), we can extend the chain of possession by adding another *'s*-possessor to the left of the existing sequence, or another *'s*-possessee to the right. 

**Expanded Sentence (adding a layer to the possessor):**
